<main class="content"><header><span class="eyebrow">GN Central · Member lifecycle</span><h1>Member Operations</h1><p class="intro">One working area for reporting, renewal, meetings, collaborative projects and annual action planning—designed around the new Global Network Handbook.</p></header>
<section class="status-grid"><article class="metric"><span>Current tier</span><strong>Associate</strong><small>In good standing</small></article><article class="metric"><span>Next report</span><strong>31 Dec</strong><small>164 days remaining</small></article><article class="metric"><span>Renewal window</span><strong>Open</strong><small>Online year-round</small></article><article class="metric"><span>Action plan</span><strong>62%</strong><small>4 of 7 objectives active</small></article></section>
<nav class="tabs" aria-label="Member operations sections"><button class="active" data-tab="reporting">Reporting &amp; Renewal</button><button data-tab="meetings">Meetings &amp; Events</button><button data-tab="projects">Collaborative Projects</button><button data-tab="planning">Action Planning</button></nav>

<section class="module active" id="reporting"><div class="section-head"><div><h2>Reporting &amp; Renewal Centre</h2><p>Complete the two six-month activity reports, maintain evidence, renew membership and request an eligible level change from one record.</p></div><span class="pill">In good standing</span></div><div class="two"><article class="panel"><h3>Current cycle</h3><div class="steps"><div class="step"><b>✓</b><div><strong>January–June activity report</strong><small>Submitted 8 July 2026 · evidence verified</small></div><span class="pill">Complete</span></div><div class="step"><b>2</b><div><strong>July–December activity report</strong><small>Draft opens 1 December · due 31 December 2026</small></div><span class="pill amber">Upcoming</span></div><div class="step"><b>3</b><div><strong>Annual renewal</strong><small>Profile, declarations and payment confirmation</small></div><span class="pill blue">Available</span></div></div><p>Overall annual compliance</p><div class="progress"><i style="width:58%"></i></div></article><article class="panel"><h3>Membership status</h3><p><strong>Tier:</strong> Associate Member<br><strong>Member since:</strong> 1 August 2025<br><strong>Renewal date:</strong> 1 August 2026<br><strong>Level-change eligibility:</strong> Eligible at renewal after one full year.</p><div class="actions"><button class="button gold" data-demo="Payment gateway hand-off is ready for connection to the approved IDA payment provider.">Continue to payment</button><button class="button secondary" data-demo="A tier-change request may be submitted with this renewal.">Request tier change</button></div></article></div>
<div class="section-head"><div><h2>Prepare a six-month report</h2><p>The prototype saves a review draft on this device. The production version will upload the report and media to the member’s controlled profile.</p></div></div><article class="panel"><form data-draft="six-month-report" data-message="Six-month report draft saved. It has not been formally submitted."><div class="form-grid"><label>Reporting period<select name="period"><option>July–December 2026</option><option>January–June 2027</option></select></label><label>Organization<input name="organization" value="Current member organization"></label><label>People reached<input name="people" type="number" placeholder="Enter verified total"></label><label>Activities delivered<input name="activities" type="number" placeholder="Workshops, events or services"></label></div><label>Key activities, outcomes and learning<textarea name="summary" placeholder="Summarize the most important work and its effect..."></textarea></label><div class="form-grid"><label>Photographs and documents<input name="evidence" type="file" multiple accept="image/*,.pdf,.doc,.docx"></label><label>Video link<input name="video" type="url" placeholder="https://vimeo.com/..."></label></div><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="consent">I confirm that uploaded media may be stored on the member profile and that appropriate permissions have been obtained.</label><div class="actions"><button class="button teal" type="submit">Save report draft</button><button class="button secondary" type="button" data-demo="Formal submission will lock the reporting period and notify authorized GN administrators.">Preview submission</button></div></form></article><div class="notice"><strong>Production connection:</strong> Formal submission, secure evidence storage and payment processing require the GN Central database, signed-in member identity and approved payment provider. No financial details are collected in this prototype.</div></section>

<section class="module" id="meetings"><div class="section-head"><div><h2>Meetings &amp; Events Hub</h2><p>A permission-aware calendar for confirmed meetings, attendance, agendas, recordings and approved archives.</p></div><span class="pill amber">Future dates on hold</span></div><div class="notice"><strong>IDA Home Office calendar notice — 21 July 2026:</strong> Steve O’Brien is reviewing the remaining meeting dates for 2026. GN Central will not publish provisional future dates until Dana Nwoye confirms that the finalized calendar has been posted.</div><div class="two"><div class="list"><article><span class="date">SEP<br>2026</span><div><h3>Global Network Community Forum</h3><p>Moving from July to September · exact date and time pending confirmation</p></div><span class="pill amber">Date pending</span></article><article><span class="date">2026<br>CAL</span><div><h3>Current committee calendar</h3><p>January 2026 edition · retained as a reference while revisions are finalized</p></div><a class="button secondary" href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1nOSVigpJwGitaUJ2Hjuj0rgWIIoRS7rH/view?usp=drive_link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Committee access</a></article><article><span class="date">NEXT<br>DATES</span><div><h3>Balance-of-year meetings</h3><p>Under review by the GN Committee Chair · no dates published</p></div><span class="pill blue">Awaiting IDA</span></article></div><article class="panel"><h3>Meeting archive</h3><p>Completed meetings remain available according to authority level. Committee minutes, votes, access details and raw transcripts are restricted.</p><div class="steps"><div class="step"><b>✓</b><div><strong>15 July 2026 Executive Committee</strong><small>7:30 AM Eastern · agenda on record · summary pending</small></div><span class="pill amber">Committee</span></div><div class="step"><b>✓</b><div><strong>29 April 2026 Executive Committee</strong><small>Agenda · approved meeting summary</small></div><span class="pill amber">Committee</span></div><div class="step"><b>✓</b><div><strong>February 2026 Sip &amp; Chat</strong><small>Summary · shared resources</small></div><span class="pill">Member</span></div></div></article></div></section>

<section class="module" id="projects"><div class="section-head"><div><h2>Collaborative Projects Workspace</h2><p>Develop cross-network initiatives, invite participating organizations and move proposals through transparent review and monitoring.</p></div><span class="pill amber">Policy alignment required</span></div><div class="three"><article class="card"><h3>1 · Develop</h3><p>Define the shared need, intended beneficiaries, participating members and measurable result.</p></article><article class="card"><h3>2 · Review</h3><p>Authorized reviewers assess strategic fit, feasibility, safeguards, budget and global value.</p></article><article class="card"><h3>3 · Deliver</h3><p>Approved projects record agreements, milestones, evidence, spending and final outcomes.</p></article></div><article class="panel"><form data-draft="project-proposal" data-message="Collaborative project concept saved as a private draft."><div class="form-grid"><label>Project title<input name="title" placeholder="Concise working title"></label><label>Lead organization<input name="lead" placeholder="Member organization"></label><label>Participating members<input name="participants" placeholder="Organizations or countries"></label><label>Proposed duration<select name="duration"><option>Up to 6 months</option><option>7–12 months</option><option>More than 12 months</option></select></label></div><label>Shared need and proposed response<textarea name="need" placeholder="What problem will members address together?"></textarea></label><div class="form-grid"><label>Expected result<input name="result" placeholder="Measurable outcome"></label><label>Estimated budget<input name="budget" placeholder="Currency and total"></label></div><div class="actions"><button class="button teal" type="submit">Save concept</button><button class="button secondary" type="button" data-demo="The review rubric checks strategic fit, feasibility, safeguards, budget and expected global value.">View review criteria</button></div></form></article><div class="notice">The historical source forms use older Partner-only wording. Publication and formal submission should be enabled only after the forms are reconciled with the approved Handbook.</div></section>

<section class="module" id="planning"><div class="section-head"><div><h2>Member Action Planning</h2><p>Translate annual priorities into owned, measurable objectives that can feed the programme-health dashboard.</p></div><span class="pill">2026 plan active</span></div><div class="two"><article class="panel"><h3>Plan progress</h3><p>Four objectives are active, two are complete and one has not started.</p><div class="progress"><i style="width:62%"></i></div><div class="steps"><div class="step"><b>✓</b><div><strong>Teacher awareness programme</strong><small>Target exceeded · 420 teachers reached</small></div><span class="pill">Complete</span></div><div class="step"><b>2</b><div><strong>Family support expansion</strong><small>72% · evidence updated 15 July</small></div><span class="pill blue">On track</span></div><div class="step"><b>3</b><div><strong>Regional collaboration</strong><small>35% · partner confirmation pending</small></div><span class="pill amber">Watch</span></div></div></article><article class="panel"><h3>Add an objective</h3><form data-draft="action-plan" data-message="Action-plan objective saved as a draft."><label>Objective<input name="objective" placeholder="Specific annual objective"></label><div class="form-grid"><label>Owner<input name="owner" placeholder="Responsible person"></label><label>Target date<input name="date" type="date"></label></div><label>Success indicator<input name="kpi" placeholder="How will progress be measured?"></label><label>Starting status<select name="status"><option>Not started</option><option>On track</option><option>Needs attention</option></select></label><button class="button teal" type="submit">Save objective</button></form></article></div></section>
</main></div><div class="toast" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div><script src="{{ asset('assets/dashboard/gn-central/preview-assets') }}/gn-operations.js"></script></body></html>
